{"ID":"20240118151128-fzgygs8","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151128-fzgygs8","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151128-fzgygs8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151128-ecogs6c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122131344-k1lyk2f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122131344-k1lyk2f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:247,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:260\u0026#125;","title":"193泽兰","type":"doc","updated":"20240201112639"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151128-ecogs6c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151128-ecogs6c","updated":"20240122131316"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名龙枣。味苦，微温，无毒。治乳妇衄血，中风余疾，大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，骨节中水，金疮，痈肿疮脓。生诸大泽旁。一名虎兰。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131320-0v98v2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131320-0v98v2x"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】生于溪涧或湿地，叶类薄荷，根紫黑色，叶与子根（地笋）皆入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131322-7kvttzd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131322-7kvttzd"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦甘，性微温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131324-igsdu8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131324-igsdu8a"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】泽兰为女科要药，功能行血消水，主养血气，破宿瘀，消症瘕痈肿，胎前产后诸病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131326-lewhhkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131326-lewhhkg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】产后腹痛，频产血气衰冷，成劳瘦羸，妇人血沥腰痛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131328-phepoaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131328-phepoaf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】胎前产后百病，通九窍，利关节，养血气破宿血，消症瘕，通小肠，长肌肉，消扑损瘀血，治鼻血吐血，头风目痛，妇人劳瘦，丈夫面黄。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131330-1059dbg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131330-1059dbg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【灵胎】清湿热，治水肿。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131332-9cb4n59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131332-9cb4n59"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131333-a69rre9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131333-a69rre9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】破血通积，大虚不宜。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131318-kjcgs62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131318-kjcgs62"}},{"ID":"20240122131334-t4esg9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131334-t4esg9h"}},{"ID":"20240122131334-7jdsa4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131334-7jdsa4y","updated":"20240201112409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一百九十三，泽兰。当然你可以用在很多地方，最主要我们使用泽兰的时候是妇科，妇科用得最多。女科里面用得最多，最主要是它能够活血，行血，消水，排水，所以一般来说如果女人有大腹水肿，身面四肢浮肿，女人很多肿哦，水肿很多，那关节骨节里面有水，累积在里面，都可以用泽兰，所以泽兰是最主要是行水，行血，消水的重要的药物。几乎你看到一个女人，过胖，身上有积水，统统可以使用，泽兰本身没有毒，剂量用大都没有关系。诸位看，这个是海藻，长这个样子。这个就是泽兰，那个中药我们有一句话叫做好吃的就是你平时吃的，不好吃的就是生病时候吃的，所以这个是海藻，这是泽兰，你们可以传阅一下。海藻因为质比较轻，所以一钱两钱就很多了，那泽兰呢，质也比较轻，一钱两钱三钱，你看剂量，如果水肿的很厉害，加重。"}]},{"ID":"20240122131344-k1lyk2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131344-k1lyk2f","updated":"20240201112639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泽兰呢，味是苦味的，甘味的混合，苦甘的。【药性】是温性的药，积水大部分都是寒症的，所以，他能够温水，就是能够让水气化出来。【主治】，泽兰功能行水，行血，消水，他能够养血气。胎前产前，妇人在怀孕中间有水肿，经方里面张仲景没有选用泽兰，张仲景用别的药，但泽兰也可以使用没有关系。【大明】呢，他说妇人劳瘦，最后，丈夫面黄，黄瘦都可以使用。一般来说我们黄的话，病人有积水，有一种黄疸，有这种积水的时候我们可以看到都可以使用泽兰。【徐灵胎】你看，治水肿。那么多名家，都讲泽兰能够消水，所以，诸位记得，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"水肿的时候，泽兰是利尿剂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]}